{"id": "De73NQsyWSU", "title": "Video by unlock.depths", "description": "Before the first light touches the Ganga, a whole village is already awake. 🌅\n\nThe kheer is cooking on the mango-wood chulha, the soop is filled with thekua and fruit, the daura is lifted onto a father’s head, and the sindoor runs from nose to forehead. In the evening we bow to the setting sun, through the night the kosi glows with diyas, and at dawn thousands stand in the water to welcome Suruj Dev. 🙏\n\nछठी मइया सबका घर-परिवार में सुख, समृद्धि और खुशहाली बनवले रहस। 🪔\n\nThis is Bihar’s Chhath, told in Madhubani colours. 🧡\n\n🎵 Song: Kelwa Ke Paat Par\nTag someone who’s waiting to go home for Chhath. 💛. #ChhathPuja #ChhathMahaparv #Bihar #MadhubaniArt #bhojpuri", "channel": "unlock.depths", "uploader_id": "56919770413", "uploader": "Unlock Depths", "timestamp": 1792970182, "like_count": 356021, "comment_count": 1450, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1654430396342505a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 71.24, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNsskn7nGGsH9R8OEog70tFlUnACtqMyt0d2aCgsthM7uY0L4TpZFbjMuopzgqAIrlZI0VpEBOhPMjRsDKnm2bU5LYcwAmislhr65o.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=UVLXenlWLjwQ7kNvwGcB49j&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=S8Q0f0r2UUHCxf9KsHoC_w&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSb0x9SZ46PWkynnoYWknfV7eV3VtyM3OgwrlNSKpbDWw&oe=6AF3E2F8", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 71.24, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-